WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.439
From the moment we are born, our surroundings start to shape us.

00:00:03.439 --> 00:00:06.040
At first, it's all about our five senses.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.519
What we see, hear, smell, touch, and taste.

00:00:09.519 --> 00:00:13.560
These five senses help us learn who we love and what makes us feel safe.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.559
As we grow up, our surroundings keep shaping us.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:21.600
We start to know who we are, what we like in friends, how we like to spend our time,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.440
and what kinds of events make us feel different things.

